WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.171 --> 00:00:14.028
<v Maya>Welcome to the deep dive. I want you to picture something for a second. Whenever we hear about humans and artificial intelligence working together, it's, you know, it's usually pitched to us as this sort of technological superhero suit.</v>

