5
00:00:40.943 --> 00:00:42.364
<v Daniel>the massive pattern recognition.</v>

6
00:00:42.444 --> 00:00:57.372
<v Maya>Yeah, that exact premise. But and this is what we're looking at today. What if you put on that multimillion dollar suit and instead of flying off into the sunset, you just immediately trip over your own feet? What if the hard data actually tells us that adding AI to a human workflow makes</v>

7
00:00:57.432 --> 00:01:12.295
<v Maya>us worse at our jobs? Because that is the mission of today's deep dive. We are looking at a stack of incredibly revealing research to figure out if human AI synergy is actually real, or if it's just this like persistent myth that we've all completely bought</v>

