00:01:12.335 --> 00:01:12.555
<v Maya>into.</v>

9
00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:27.844
<v Daniel>And we do have several crucial studies on the table today to help unpack that for you. But the absolute centerpiece of our discussion, like the main lens we'll be looking through, is a brand new, truly fascinating paper. It was published on September 21, 2026 in the</v>

