31
00:04:35.423 --> 00:04:37.184
<v Maya>Wait, really? Bad science?</v>

32
00:04:37.224 --> 00:04:52.028
<v Daniel>Yeah, a brand new analysis suggests researchers have been operating with this massive blind spot. And this is where Julian Berger's team comes in. They looked at that depressing 2024 meta-analysis of all 74 studies and asked a brilliant foundational question.</v>

33
00:04:52.428 --> 00:04:52.968
<v Maya>Which was?</v>

34
00:04:53.048 --> 00:04:57.270
<v Daniel>Did any of these experiments actually give humans the chance to learn how to use the AI?</v>

35
00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:01.711
