00:11:13.297 --> 00:11:17.258
<v Maya>OK, so they had the magic combo explanation plus feedback. What happened?</v>

89
00:11:17.585 --> 00:11:27.049
<v Daniel>Banzal's team tested AI explanations on tasks like sentiment analysis, you know, judging if a book review is positive or negative, and answering tough logic questions from the LSAT.</v>

